      },
      "message": "docs(process): weight every issue by effort and route it to a matching worker agent\n\nAGENTS.md Issue Law gains \"Every issue is weighted by effort\": one\neffort:low|medium|high|max label beside P*, set at filing from a table,\nwith a safety floor (G-code, collision, sim, geometry and every P0 are at\nleast effort:high). Issues are dispatched to .claude/agents/issue-worker-\n<effort>.md (haiku / sonnet / opus / fable), which run the new shared\n/work-issue skill. Reviews run at least on the medium tier (high under the\nfloor). A worker that fails its gate twice or finds the work bigger\nescalates the label one step and releases the issue. The review-prs cost\ncomment records the effort and any escalation for recalibration.\n\nPROCESS_VERSION 5 -> 6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
